      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow1:071",
        "answer": "The constructor requests StartAddingSticky and PreSetupMenuChat before the FrontendChatClient creation request. It registers ordered Offline and PassiveMode predicates returning exactly not CoD.PCUtility.IsBGSEnabled() and not CoD.PCUtility.MenuChatIsActive(controller); the supplied helpers forward an opaque Engine result and a model-get result, respectively, without proving actual BGS/chat state. It registers two chat-model callbacks; when actually delivered, their bodies request menu:updateElementState with the exact validation table/model:get(), not a guaranteed state change. It registers a setState callback which, if delivered, requests RetriggerCursorPosition(captured menu,delivered controller), ClearRecordedFocusIfFocusAncestor(menu,controller,self.ChatClient), then ClearRecordedInputFocusIfInputFocusAncestor with the same arguments. The cursor helper has its own free-cursor/root/w [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
